# Local IPOs: the info panels of a listed industry area's main building and of a listed unique
# factory show the same listing section as a zoned headquarters' panel (gold title bar, listing,
# stake, Buy / Sell / Show in Investments), at the bottom; the game's rows keep their place. With
# the company gone the panel is the game's own again. Needs a city with an industry area at level
# 3+ and a unique factory; their profit and workers are fixed for the scenario (ipo-site-profit,
# ipo-site-workers) and the city's own counts are set aside
# (ipo-forget). Everything listed is removed in cleanup.
name local ipos: an area's main building and a unique factory show the listing on their panels
close-economy
local-ipos on
ipo-forget
ipo-healthy-days 1
ipo-site-profit 500000
ipo-site-workers 120
ipo-scan
ipo-dialog on
ipo-list-now area
wait 1
ipo-view
wait 1.5
expect-no-overflow CaptionPanel
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingListing
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingBadge OFFERING
# too narrow for "Oil industry area · …": the line drops the kind, the panel names it
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingLine First trading day
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingBuy Buy at the offering price
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingSell
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingListing
expect-no-overlap MainSectionPanel FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingListing
capture area-building-panel
# the area's own panel gets a Shares tab with the same section
ipo-area-panel
wait 1.5
capture area-info-tab
# the Info tab stays the game's own until Shares is picked
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulAreaTabPage
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulAreaTabButton
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAreaTabButton Shares
click FinanceOverhaulAreaTabButton
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulAreaTabListing
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAreaTabBadge OFFERING
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulAreaTabListing
capture area-shares-tab
ipo-dialog on
ipo-list-now factory
wait 1
ipo-view
wait 1.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulAreaBuildingListing
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulFactoryGold
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulFactoryListing
expect-text FinanceOverhaulFactoryLine Unique factory · First trading day
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulFactoryListing
expect-no-overlap IncomeExpensesSection FinanceOverhaulFactoryListing
expect-no-overlap Misc FinanceOverhaulFactoryListing
capture factory-panel
ipo-remove-test
wait 1.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulFactoryListing
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulFactoryGold
# the area is gone too: its panel loses the tab
ipo-dialog on
ipo-list-now area
wait 1
ipo-dialog close
ipo-area-panel
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulAreaTabButton
ipo-remove-test
wait 1
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulAreaTabButton
cleanup:
ipo-dialog close
ipo-site-profit real
ipo-site-workers real
ipo-remove-test
local-ipos restore
